+# N25 conditional validation preparation v1
+
+CPU source preparation only while the frozen N25 Dev controller runs. This is a new preparation scope after completed Phase B, not activation of protected validation. Current Dev source, plan, release, controller, state, budgets and all outcomes remain untouched.
+
+## Entry and immutable science
+
+Require the actual immutable N25 Dev result and root terminal review: all 40 accepted cells, N25 >=5/10 and >= C0/Q0/N23, all existing native/source/compute/cost/substantive-QD/ED gates. Partial, numeric-futility and INVALID dispositions cannot enter. Frozen Dev plan SHA 1f0c94ccd3458a3a786acb9525728a1b64e3df439e4f920731f6566dd3a95eb3; source commit 5a65ef15968cc68c82314e8c0773b3365ad45fa0, 257-file manifest SHA fafcb0d881c95d567cb14a6690145d4ad933abc84a5e0175dfbe1512efd836ee. Preserve every scientific/config/provider/native arithmetic and evidence file; N25 clipped RBF modes, N23 quality, N7 descriptor, N5 selection and rescue OFF unchanged. C0/Q0 unchanged. 720 steps,20Hz,8 actions,pop16,10 rounds,176 canonical evaluations/11 batches unchanged.
+
+The existing N24 conditional validation implementation is a source reference only, never an authority for N25. Create an isolated validation_implementation under this N25 variant from exact Dev commit. Only new validation identity/evaluation/accounting modules and a minimal explicit worker validate_context routing insertion may change. Every other existing worker function and shared runner/core file remains identical. Provide a full exact 257-file bridge and reverse insertion; no copied function code or shared-global replacement. Preserve existing native N25 first-guided witnesses/all-call scalar checks and original cost accounting, including valid zero-gradient behavior and strict zero-guided accounting. Reuse settled native proof only via exact unchanged arithmetic source plus explicit Dev-to-validation source bridge; no new GPU probe.
+
+## Closed evaluation protocol
+
+Prepare exactly 60 matched primary cells: two task blocks0..9, arms C0/Q0/N25,20 per arm. At later root adoption choose first completely unused preregistered validation cohort c1..c4 from frozen identity metadata, exposure registry and dispatched identity metadata only. Any exposure/dispatch consumes its whole cohort regardless of outcome/validity/arm. Never read protected outcome to choose seeds; no partial-cohort replacement or per-task tuning. This measures same-layout seed robustness. One protected cohort per candidate, no restart after INVALID or rejection.
+
+At most two narrowly typed sole-Codex-timeout whole-episode recoveries, one per cell, max62 attempts; use unchanged Dev E2 classifier and all evidence/source/cost requirements. No retry of valid failure, arithmetic or algorithm error, absent evidence or other invalidity. Retain invalid originals and first-valid selection. One serial GPU7, same UUID/EGL/runtime,1800s+40s per episode, local32 GPU-process hours maximum, all historical costs retained. Cumulative494 attempts/100 GPU hours; buckets55 baseline/199 development/180 validation/40 formal/20 recovery; protected validation/formal reserves32/12 hours unchanged. No budget amendment or transfer here. Full required attempt/hour capacity and formal reserve must actually fit at adoption and before every dispatch; otherwise no launch.
+
+All60 accepted cells and N25 >=10/20 and >=C0/Q0 plus existing gates required. No partial promotion or outcome-driven early stop rule. Report paired outcomes, actual denominators, errors/recoveries and measured costs. Root consumes aggregate validation disposition for subsequent decisions; protected per-task/seed outcomes are not tuning data. Formal acceptance and substantive compute-matched QD-replacement ablation remain separately closed. No formal launcher in this scope.
+
+## Provider, preparation and activation
+
+Online Stage remains only current managed Codex login via codex_cli/chatgpt, gpt-6-astra/low/E2/180s. No Poe, alternate account, provider fallback, new guidance/grounding API or credential inspection/copy/hash; preserve saved Poe credentials untouched. Frozen cached guidance only.
+
+CPU executor may read only frozen source/metadata and closed implementation reports, use synthetic fixtures with two CPU threads and an explicit guard blocking real attempt/protected payloads, network, model/API/simulator, GPU initialization and dispatch. No active W/state/budget/ledger/Arbor mutation. Do not inspect actual Dev outcome payloads during preparation. Own all new artifacts beneath N25/validation_implementation and distinctly named N25 validation-preparation files. Preserve failures and avoid duplicate unrelated tests. Deliver clean commit, exact source/reverse bridge, substantive synthetic tests (including split artifact/controller paths), disabled templates and honest unresolved limitations.
+
+Protected execution requires, in order, actual complete Dev promotion and root terminal review; root review/integration of exact validation source; metadata-only fresh identities and sufficient capacity; adopted specific validation authority; frozen plan and separate exact execution release. Preparation or a ready template grants none of these. Do not interrupt or modify active N25 Dev to accelerate readiness.
